# N2: exactness of the combined best, strictly. The S3a matrix plan on c2-packed-tp4-best-gate: four real-text users at 4,096 / 16,384 /
# 32,768 / 60,000 tokens, 512 tokens out, a concurrent arm (all four at once) and a solo arm (one at a time), strict policy: every
# concurrent text must equal its solo text. Every audit the profile carries is on (the verify T1 and T2, the fused commit, the singles,
# the vglue levers). The prompts are the image's own real-text corpus by (user, length), so they are the S3a prompts: the SOLO and
# CONCURRENT texts must equal S3a's offline (every lever and the fused commit are byte-identical replacements).
# C2_GATE_JIT=record: the kernel cache holds no entry for the new launches, so the first arm compiles them; the growth is recorded.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image N0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2 is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built
# from the pushed branch; the driver's IMAGE_TAG env overrides it.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; per arm one engine build 10-30 min plus 6-16 min of streams (the audits copy and replay): two
# arms 40-90 min; a reproduced divergence re-runs both arms once: up to 170 min.
# STOP on the gate exit (strict): any concurrent text differing from its solo text fails the job, and so does an audit mismatch.
# Read: the gate verdict per arm; per user IDENTICAL concurrent against solo; the fused-commit and vglue audit lines (exact, none
# mismatch); the vglue engaged counts and no fell-back line; zero refusals; the [ACCEPT] line. Then offline: the solo and concurrent
# texts against S3a's (byte identical).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-3a
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,16384,32768,60000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=512
C2_GATE_JIT=record
